{"ID":"20240206140930-iz8uqmu","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206140930-iz8uqmu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140930-iz8uqmu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140940-k3rbqn5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140935-ao4lm2r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206140940-k3rbqn5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:121,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:121\u0026#125;","title":"枫香脂（白胶香）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902090126"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206140940-k3rbqn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140940-k3rbqn5","updated":"20240206140945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产江西、福建、云南、浙江等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈不规则块状，或呈类圆形颗粒状，大小不等，直径多在0.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1cm之间，少数可达3cm。表面淡黄色至黄棕色，半透明或不透明。质脆易碎，破碎面具玻璃样光泽。气清香，燃烧时香气更浓，味淡。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，平。\n【功效】\t祛风活血；解毒止痛；止血；生肌。用于痈疽；疮疹；瘰疬；齿痛；痹痛；瘫痪；吐血；衄血；咯血；外伤出血；皮肤皲裂。"}]},{"ID":"20240206140935-ao4lm2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206140935-ao4lm2r","updated":"20240206140935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206140935-f37bpc4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715102443-jxgeryc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715102443-jxgeryc","updated":"20240715102510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 544px;","style":"width: 534px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"枫香树 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/枫香树 7-20240715102443-a7y9qhi.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 534px;\" parent-style=\"width: 544px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 613px;","style":"width: 603px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"枫香树 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/枫香树 8-20240715102510-y2s5ntf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 603px;\" parent-style=\"width: 613px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715101803-25b60z7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715101803-25b60z7","updated":"20240715101852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 768px;","style":"width: 758px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"枫香树 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/枫香树 3-20240715101803-gkxddp9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 758px;\" parent-style=\"width: 768px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 436px;","style":"width: 426px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"枫香树 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/枫香树 4-20240715101852-ih1sfhx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 426px;\" parent-style=\"width: 436px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727130033-gl91vy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727130033-gl91vy8","updated":"20240727130033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 643px;","style":"width: 633px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"路路通"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/路路通-20240727130033-ssn346t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 633px;\" parent-style=\"width: 643px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 578px;","style":"width: 568px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"路路通 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/路路通 1-20240727130125-hg6om8t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 568px;\" parent-style=\"width: 578px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902090055-b0zwont","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090055-b0zwont","updated":"20240902090055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 640px;","style":"width: 630px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"枫香树"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/枫香树-20240715095703-ox2pap9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 630px;\" parent-style=\"width: 640px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 571px;","style":"width: 561px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"枫香"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/枫香-20240715095707-atihbbf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 561px;\" parent-style=\"width: 571px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902090055-5sq3g0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090055-5sq3g0k","updated":"20240902090055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 641px;","style":"width: 631px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"枫香树 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/枫香树 5-20240715102110-9llwls6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 631px;\" parent-style=\"width: 641px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 568px;","style":"width: 558px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"枫香树 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/枫香树 6-20240715102309-al4utha.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 558px;\" parent-style=\"width: 568px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715101621-imwm5ba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715101621-imwm5ba","updated":"20240715101701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 582px;","style":"width: 572px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"枫香树 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/枫香树 1-20240715101621-fbkghk0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 572px;\" parent-style=\"width: 582px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 595px;","style":"width: 585px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"枫香树 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/枫香树 2-20240715101701-clfbpiq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 585px;\" parent-style=\"width: 595px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715095556-wm5qkcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715095556-wm5qkcf","updated":"20240715095611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为枫香树的树脂。"}]},{"ID":"20240715095555-k1o7svr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240715095555-k1o7svr"}},{"ID":"20240902090119-sjpw15g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-sjpw15g","updated":"20240902090126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：枫香脂"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-dqkc83o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-dqkc83o","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"枫香脂《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-88afov0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-88afov0","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】FēnɡXiānɡZhī"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-bim6l3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-bim6l3s","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】RESINALIQUIDAMBARIS"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-tzwlxez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-tzwlxez","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】白胶香"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-3hm5buy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-3hm5buy","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为金缕梅科植物枫香树LiquidambarformosanaHance的干燥树脂。7、8月间割裂树干，使树脂流出，10月至次年4月采收，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-rc5mp0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-rc5mp0u","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈不规则块状，淡黄色至黄棕色，半透明或不透明。质脆，断面具光泽。气香，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-gk19crq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-gk19crq","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-xy8z4uj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-xy8z4uj","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）取本品少量，用微火灼烧，有多烟火焰，具特异香气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-c8hync3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-c8hync3","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品约50mg，置试管中，加四氯化碳5ml，振摇使溶解，沿管壁加硫酸2ml,两液接界处显红色环。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-mgi64xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-mgi64xw","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）取本品约0.2g，加四氯化碳5ml,振摇使成混悬液，加硝酸3ml,轻轻摇匀，待分层，上层液显淡红色至红橙色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-lhx0dr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-lhx0dr8","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛、微苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-7x2c3om","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-7x2c3om","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-ifl08v1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-ifl08v1","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】活血止痛，解毒，生肌，凉血。用于跌扑损伤，痈疽肿痛，吐血，衄血，外伤出血。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-0nno6ud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-0nno6ud","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】1.5～3g,宜入丸散服；外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-nywqs8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-nywqs8j","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-x3bbndu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-x3bbndu","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"枫香脂《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-qr5w5vn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-qr5w5vn","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《尔雅》郭璞注：\"枫，树似白杨，叶圆而歧，有脂而香，今枫香是。\"《南方草木状》：\"其子大如鸭卵；二月花发，乃连着实，八、九月熟。暴干可烧，惟九真郡有之。\"唐《新修本草》首载枫香脂，谓：\"所在大山皆有。树高大，叶三角，商洛之间多有。五月研树为坎，十一月采脂。\"《纲目》收枫香脂于木部香木类,云：\"枫木枝干修耸,大者连数围。其木甚坚,有赤有白,白者细腻。其实成球,有柔刺。\"据所述形态，均与金缕梅科植物枫"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-w4p5zny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-w4p5zny","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】FēnɡXiānɡZhī"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-1hos1qh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-1hos1qh","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】白胶香、枫脂、白胶、芸香、胶香。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-nrcqvot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-nrcqvot","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-0u5rv28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-0u5rv28","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为金缕梅科植物枫香树的树脂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-0d066ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-0d066ez","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：LiquidambarformosanaHance"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-6v2mvzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-6v2mvzc","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：选择生长20年以上的粗壮大树，于7-8月间凿开树皮，从树根起每隔15-20cm交错凿开一洞。到11月至次年3月间采收流出的树脂。晒干或自然干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-xdw6b0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-xdw6b0n","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】枫香树落叶乔木，高20-40m。树皮灰褐色，方块状剥落。叶互生；叶柄长3-7cm；托叶线形，早落；叶片心形，常3裂，幼时及萌发枝上的叶多为掌状5裂，长6-12cm，宽8-15cm，裂片卵状三角形或卵形，先端尾状渐尖，基部心形，边缘有细锯齿，齿尖有腺状突。花单性，雌雄同株，无花被；雄花淡黄绿色，成葇荑花序再排成总状，生于枝顶；雄蕊多数，花丝不等长；雌花排成圆球形的头状花序；萼齿5，钻形；子房半下位，2室，花柱2，柱头弯曲。头状果序圆球形，直径2.5-4.5cm，表面有刺，蒴果有宿存花萼和花柱，两瓣裂开，每瓣2浅裂。种子多数，细小，扁平。花期3-4月，果期9-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-i99qre4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-i99qre4","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-sdvwpyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-sdvwpyf","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于山地常绿阔叶林中。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-7d42e7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-7d42e7v","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于秦岭及淮河以南各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-bhdw8vg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-bhdw8vg","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】性状鉴别本品呈不规则块状，或呈类圆形颗粒状，大小不等，直径多在0.5-1cm之间，少数可达3cm。表面淡黄色至黄棕色，半透明或不透明。质脆易碎，破碎面具玻璃样光泽。气清香，燃烧时香气更浓，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-u8prnan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-u8prnan","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】枫香树脂含阿姆布酮酸(ambronicacid，即模绕酮酸moronicacid)，阿姆布醇酸(ambrolicacid，即模绕酸morolicacid)，阿姆布二醇酸(ambradiolicacid)，路路通酮酸(liquidambronicacid)，路路通二醇酸(liquidambrodiolicacid)，枫香脂熊果酸(forucosolicacid)，枫香脂诺维酸(liquidambronovicacid)。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-bip332a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-bip332a","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】枫香脂及其挥发油体外实验可使兔血栓长度缩短和重量（湿重和干重）减轻，在体实验显示可明显抑制大鼠血栓形成；试管法实验表明可明显提高纤溶酶活性，显着提高血小板内cAMP含量。表明枫香脂及其挥发油抗血栓作用与促进纤溶活性和提高血小板cAMP有关，并提示挥发油可能是枫香脂的主要止血成分。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-dipbene","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-dipbene","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-v5urbqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-v5urbqo","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理化鉴别（1）取本品少量，燃烧，有浓烟及火焰，具特异香气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-mp3k95r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-mp3k95r","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品约50mg，置试管中，加四氯化碳5ml，振摇使溶解，沿管壁加硫酸2ml，两液接界处显红色环。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-3mb14st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-3mb14st","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）取本品约0.2g，加四氯化碳5ml，振摇使成混悬液，加硝酸3ml，轻轻摇匀，待分层，上层液显淡红色至红橙色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-xnvfdrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-xnvfdrb","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】《简要济众方》：\"细研为散。\"《纲目》：\"凡用以虀水煮二十沸，入冷水中，揉扯数十次，晒干用。\"《外科全生集》：\"水煮三天，候汤温，手扯油净，冷即硬。\"现行，取原药材，除去杂质，捣碎。饮片性状：见\"药材鉴别\"项。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-w2b5his","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-w2b5his","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛；苦；平"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-tl2xo8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-tl2xo8q","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】脾；肺；肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-fztpg3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-fztpg3h","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛风活血；解毒止痛；止血；生肌。主痈疽；疮疹；瘰疬；齿痛；痹痛；瘫痪；吐血；衄血；咯血；外伤出血；皮肤皲裂"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-e6b744w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-e6b744w","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】外用：适量，研末撒或调敷或制膏摊贴，亦可制成熏烟药。内服：煎汤，3-6g；一般入丸、散剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-wp3w0t5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-wp3w0t5","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】孕妇禁服。《得配本草》：\"内服多不宜。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-ykddrem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-ykddrem","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】《说文》：“枫，木也。厚叶弱枝，善摇。”言其树叶因风而摇，枫之为名，由此而得。《本草图经》云：“《尔雅》谓‘枫为(木聂)(木聂)。’言天(大)风则鸣鸣(木聂)(木聂)也。”此又引《尔雅》之文，释“枫”之取义，与风动有关。枫“有脂而香”，故又称枫香。枫香脂由胶状树脂凝结而成，呈黄白色，故又名白胶香。"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-dw8ubw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-dw8ubw4","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】1.论枫香脂主血热生风缪希雍：\"枫香脂，为活血凉血之药。凡热则生风，又血热则壅而发瘾疹，风火相搏则为浮肿，苦平能凉血热，兼辛又能散风，故主血热生风之证。风火既散，则肌肉和而浮肿自消。齿痛亦因风热上攻，风热既散，则痛自止矣。\"（《本草经疏》）2.论枫香脂治诸血证①张石顽：\"《千金》治咳唾脓血，取其开发肺气也。\"（《本经逢原》)②赵其光：\"其叶霜后即丹，其脂采于冬，辛苦而平是金得火，以生水，为活血化血之妙品，故治吐、衄、咯血。\"（《本草求原》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-08ea849","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-08ea849","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1.小金片白胶香150g，没药（醋制）75g，当归75g，乳香（醋炒）75g，木鳖子（去壳、油）150g，地龙（去土酒炒）150g，草乌（制）150g，五灵脂（醋炒）150g，京墨12g，麝香30g。以上十味，除麝香另研细粉外，其余白胶香等九味粉碎成细粉，过筛，用糯米粉300g打糊制粒，干燥后加入麝香细粉，混匀，压片，每片重0.32g，相当于原药材0.24g。为暗灰色；气微，味微苦、辛。功能消肿拔毒。用于痰核流注，乳岩瘰疬，横痃恶疮，一切阴疽初起。黄酒或温开水送服，每次4片，每日2次。孕妇忌服。（《山东省药品标准》1986年）2.小金丹白胶香（煎膏）、草乌、五灵脂、地龙肉、木鳖子（去皮）各150g，乳香、没药、当归各75g，香墨12g，麝香30g。以上十味，除麝香外，余药共为细粉，兑入麝香，和匀，用白面300g打糊为丸，每丸干重0.6g。功能活血、消结、散毒。用于瘰疬乳岩，横痃，贴骨疽等症。每次2丸，每日2次，黄酒送服，温开水亦可。忌饮烧酒及食生冷，孕妇勿服。（《全国中药成药处方集》1962年）"}]},{"ID":"20240902090119-ef08871","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090119-ef08871","updated":"20240902090130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902090120-yvhk9sg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902090120-yvhk9sg","updated":"20240902090130"}},{"ID":"20240902090121-rnd9kb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902090121-rnd9kb3","updated":"20240902090130"}}]}